{"page":20251,"part":1,"text":"○策势第五\n\n策须斫笔，背发而仰收，则背斫仰策也。两头高，中以笔心举之。口诀云：仰笔潜锋，似鳞勒之法，揭腕势于右。潜锋之要，在画势暗捷归于右也。夫策笔偃仰锋竖<走历>，微劲借势，峻顾于掠也。\n\n问曰：策一名折异画，今谓之策，何也？\n\n论曰：策之与画，理亦故殊，仰笔锋，轻抬而进，故曰策也。若及纸便画，不务迟涩，面背偃仰者，此备尽完成耳。《笔诀》云：始筑笔而仰策，徐转笔而成形是也。","eligible":true,"blockedReasons":[],"source":{"kind":"human-txt","page":20251,"part":1,"label":"wolai标准正文／原人工审核独有补充","verifiedBy":"项目负责人（本对话确认）","verifiedAt":"2026-10-22T07:57:06+00:00","revision":"345fbdb6fc82427031625ca473daaff499feb38ee6e5ede2a0215ef10c2edf1c","textSha256":"345fbdb6fc82427031625ca473daaff499feb38ee6e5ede2a0215ef10c2edf1c","fileSha256":"345fbdb6fc82427031625ca473daaff499feb38ee6e5ede2a0215ef10c2edf1c","txtPath":"annotation-data/wolai-txt/20251-wolai-5122gXdcRhagcwQXCfzxuy.txt","reviewCsvPath":"annotation-data/wolai-review.csv","standardCorpus":"wolai-standard","displayLabel":"永字八法 · ○策势第五","sourceUrl":"https://www.wolai.com/mojiyi/5122gXdcRhagcwQXCfzxuy","originalPages":[],"positionStatus":"原图只作篇目参考；新版正文不声称与旧扫描逐字对齐","provenance":[{"start":0,"end":5,"sourceTextSha256":"e244100a7c1c45eafb270b544f64dd2b8d18103412206f977662f920eb11a6d8","id":"6SyyggjX8WaykTz5Tjjck9","page_id":"5122gXdcRhagcwQXCfzxuy","root_id":"5122gXdcRhagcwQXCfzxuy","work":"永字八法","author":"佚名三篇","type":"subHeader","origin":"wolai-block","rawStart":0,"rawEnd":5},{"start":7,"end":95,"sourceTextSha256":"7bf7ebf8b96f5655dd26127bab69513e6c786a76b65cc9480b0419ebe5b20ac6","id":"vWq3XEjkY9mApQ6qNniEbk","page_id":"5122gXdcRhagcwQXCfzxuy","root_id":"5122gXdcRhagcwQXCfzxuy","work":"永字八法","author":"佚名三篇","type":"text","origin":"wolai-block","rawStart":0,"rawEnd":88},{"start":97,"end":115,"sourceTextSha256":"687d0116de24ba120ab3257c011fe498183b640f9d3eb463f0626d6b1ad689b9","id":"2pJbPxC4F62tnDTdCVBN75","page_id":"5122gXdcRhagcwQXCfzxuy","root_id":"5122gXdcRhagcwQXCfzxuy","work":"永字八法","author":"佚名三篇","type":"text","origin":"wolai-block","rawStart":0,"rawEnd":18},{"start":117,"end":190,"sourceTextSha256":"a21d57da9255f3dcf417aa1ced80455613c8e77c204f2ba8f0a4b3846655a80a","